'''Sprayonator''' is an {{Uncommon}} item.

== Obtaining ==
'''Sprayonator''' can be claimed from {{NPCSprite|Pesthunter Pamela}} once or purchased from [[SkyMart]] for {{copper|25}}.

== Usage ==
{{ItemInfo
|type = Sprayonator
|name = Sprayonator
|rarity = u
|item_ability_name = Configure
|item_ability_description = Select a nozzle and material for spraying. Certain materials attract certain types of {{mt|pest|Pests}}.
|item_ability_activation = Left Click
|item_ability_name2 = Spray
|item_ability_description2 = Sprays your selected material onto the {{Green|Garden}} plot you are on. Lasts for {{Green|30m}}.<br>
{{Green|Basic Nozzle Bonus:}}<br>
{{DarkGray|➜}} {{Stat|bonus pest chance|+25}} while in a sprayed plot.<br>
{{DarkGray|➜}} {{mt|pest|Pests}} are {{Green|1.5x}} more likely to spawn in sprayed plots.
|item_ability_activation2 = Right Click
|item_ability_cooldown2 = 3s
}}
The '''Sprayonator''' can be used to spray a [[Garden]] plot for {{Green|30}} minutes using {{Item|Compost}}, {{Item|Plant Matter}}, {{Item|Dung}}, {{Item|Honey Jar}}, {{Item|Tasty Cheese}}, or {{Item|Jelly}}. 
{{/Usage}}

=== Nozzles ===
Additional effects are applied in sprayed plots depending on the selected nozzle:
* {{Item|Basic Nozzle|link=}}: Consumes {{Green|1}} of the material. Grants {{Stat|bonus pest chance|+25}} while in a sprayed plot. Pests are {{Green|1.5x}} more likely to spawn in sprayed plots.

==Interface==
{{/UI}}

== Trivia ==
* While the {{Stat|Bonus Pest Chance}} buff is applied whenever the player is breaking crops in a sprayed plot, the increased chance for targeted {{mt|Pest|Pests}} only applies if the plot they spawn in is sprayed as well.
** Since pests can spawn either in the plot the player is farming on, or a directly adjacent plot in one of the four cardinal directions, this will result in the increased chance sometimes not being applied unless the player sprays all adjacent plots as well.
** This has been acknowledged as a limitation due to the issue of determining what to do if the two plots are both sprayed but with different materials.

